patrone-terminal (0.1.9) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Takes a new theme or title bar button style from Patrone Settings at
    once, where it needed opening again.
  * Doesn't open at sign-in when Terminal at sign-in is Off (the taskbar's
    sign-in-terminal setting, patrone-gnome-taskbar 0.4.11).
  * Its window corners match GNOME's apps, at 15 pixels, where they were 8
    at the top and square at the bottom.

