patrone-terminal (0.1.8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Its default font is PatroneOS Mono 11, PatroneOS's own (fonts-patroneos),
    in place of JetBrains Mono. Settings that hold the old default
    (JetBrains Mono 11), which an older version saved with any other
    change, take the new one; a font someone picked stays.

